return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Àwọn ìfitónilétí àṣẹ lórí SMS àti WhatsApp fún ilé-ìtajà yín, tí a fi ránṣẹ́ nípasẹ̀ Zinn® Campaigns lábẹ́ orúkọ ilé-ìtajà yín gan-an. So pọ̀ pẹ̀lú ìtẹ̀mọ́lẹ̀ kan ṣoṣo; kò sí àwọn kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ láti lẹ̀ mọ́ ọn.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Awọn imudojuiwọn aṣẹ','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Ilé-ìtajà rẹ ti sopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'A ti ge asopọ ile itaja rẹ. Ko si ifiranṣẹ kankan ti yoo ranṣẹ.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Ìsopọ̀ yẹn gba àkókò púpọ̀ tàbí a bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀ nínú àwárí kiri mìíràn. Tẹ Sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® kò gba ìsopọ̀ náà. Tẹ "Sopọ̀" lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá tún kùnà, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Aaye rẹ ko le de ọdọ Zinn®. Ṣayẹwo pe olupese rẹ ngbanilaaye awọn asopọ ti njade, lẹhinna tẹ «Tun sopọ mọ».','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Fi àwọn imudojuiwọn SMS ati WhatsApp ranṣẹ si awọn alabara rẹ nipa awọn aṣẹ wọn, labẹ orukọ ile-itaja tirẹ, ti a sanwo lati inu kirẹditi Zinn® rẹ.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Sopọ yoo ṣi Zinn® ninu ferese yii. Wọle tabi ṣẹda akọọlẹ kan, fọwọsi ile itaja yii, iwọ yoo si pada taara si ibi. O ko nilo lati lẹ kọkọrọ rara.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Sopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn a ko le de ọdọ Zinn® ni akoko yii. A o tun gbiyanju laipẹ.','Store'=>'Ilé-ìtajà','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Ṣi silẹ fun akọọlẹ rẹ','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Kò tíì ṣí sílẹ̀ fún àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ. Zinn® yóò fi imeeli ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nígbà tí ó bá ṣí.','Disconnect'=>'Ge asopọ kuro','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'A kò gba ọ́ láàyè láti so ilé-ìtajà yìí pọ̀.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'A kò fún ọ láàyè láti ge ìsopọ̀ ilé-ìtajà yìí.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà olùlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pamọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé web tí ó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ayelujara ti o ti fẹsẹmulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkànnì ati gbigbe awọn ọna asopọ si, pẹlu idaduro owo naa ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun tí wọ́n fi ń gbọ́ bùkátà','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́-àdáni àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn òǹkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àwòrán, àwọn olùgbéejáde àti àwọn akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ akanṣe kan síbẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ àtẹ̀jáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣe àmúdájú Zinn® kò pèsè àjápọ̀ ìgbasílẹ̀ fún àmúdájú yìí. Rí i dájú pé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè ráàyè sí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùnà nínú àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.']];